# The Crystal Spring in Northern San d'Oria with one Crystal Bass. The login plays SoA's Rumors from the West zone-in
# 878. Grilau's own 1009; option 250 nothing, option 111 begins. Status 0: ORIGINAL_MISSION_OFFSET + 68. The bass: 1030,
# whose finish takes it and sets status 2; Grilau 1031. The warp into Chateau d'Oraguille from Northern San d'Oria at
# status 2 plays the zone-in 555, whose finish sets status 3; Chalvatot 556, whose finish completes the mission (400
# rank points).
